@startuml
title 当前 RAG 在线问答时序

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "用户" as User
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "ChatService /\nRAGService" as Service
participant "问答编排\nCompiledGraph / 手工节点流" as Flow
participant "LLM Provider" as LLM
participant "HybridGraphRetriever" as Retriever
database "Chroma + SQLite" as Stores
participant "Reranker" as Reranker
participant "ContextBuilder" as Context

User -> API : 提交问题
API -> API : 登录鉴权
API -> Service : 获取 RAG 并发许可

alt POST /ask
  API -> Service : ask_question(query)
  Service -> Flow : compiled_graph.invoke(state)
else Web 同步或 SSE
  API -> Service : answer_sync / answer_stream
  Service -> Flow : 依次调用共享节点函数
end

note right of Service
索引状态时间戳变化时，
自动刷新 Runtime、BM25
和 Compiled LangGraph。
end note

Flow -> LLM : rewrite(original_query)
LLM --> Flow : rewritten_query
note right of Flow
检索通常同时使用
original_query 与 rewritten_query。
end note

Flow -> Retriever : retrieve_multi_query(queries)
Retriever -> Stores : Vector + 中文 BM25 + 图谱证据检索
Stores --> Retriever : 三路候选 Chunk
Retriever -> Retriever : Weighted RRF 融合并按 chunk_id 去重
Retriever --> Flow : retrieval candidates

Flow -> Reranker : rerank(original_query, candidates)
Reranker --> Flow : top documents

Flow -> Context : build_context(documents)
Context -> Context : 去重、来源配额、Token 预算、citation_id
Context --> Flow : context + sources
note right of Context
CONTEXT_JSON_EXPORT_ENABLED=true 时，
在 generate 前写入 data/debug/contexts/context_*.json。
end note

alt /ask 或 Web 同步
  Flow -> LLM : generate(query, context)
  LLM --> Flow : answer
  Flow --> Service : answer + sources
  Service --> API : 保存并返回结果
  API --> User : 最终响应
else Web SSE
  Flow -> LLM : stream_generate(query, context)
  loop 模型流式分片
    LLM --> Flow : delta
    Flow --> Service : delta
    Service --> API : SSE delta
    API --> User : SSE delta
  end
  Flow --> Service : sources + done
  Service --> API : 完成事件
  API --> User : sources + done
end

note over Retriever,Context
graph_facts 当前保存在 Document metadata 中，
接口尚未单独返回 graph_subgraph。
end note

@enduml
